This extension provides an API for communicating with Redis database,
a persistent key-value database with built-in net interface written
in ANSI-C for Posix systems.

PECL redis for php81 of azsupport/ports, with the zstd compression of az
(libzstd), built from ext/redis of the release tarball of
azsupport/php-src, which bundles it: lib/php/20210902/redis.so, loaded
by its ini in etc/php81/conf.d.

One of the four packages of redis, which have the same files:
php81-redis, php81-redis-lz4, php81-redis-lz4-zstd are the others (only
one of them installs).
